---
// 홈 = 학습 대시보드 (ADR 0011, Easyread 레이아웃):
// 이어서 학습(커버 카드) · 이번 주 목표 게이지 · 숫자 카드 · 트랙 격자 / 오른쪽 어두운 패널(로드맵 요약).
import Shell from "../layouts/Shell.astro";
import { loadBook, allChapters, str } from "../lib/book";
import { chapterSummary, isReady, trackKeyOf, trackCodeOf } from "../lib/site";
import { coverSVG } from "../lib/cover";
const { parts, config } = loadBook();
const u = (p: string) => import.meta.env.BASE_URL + p;
const tracks = (config.tracks as any[]).filter((t) => t.layer < 9);
const layers = (config.layers as any[]).filter((l) => l.level < 9).sort((a, b) => a.level - b.level);
const chaptersOf = (key: string) => parts.filter((p) => str(p.meta.track) === key).flatMap((p) => p.chapters);
const ready = allChapters().filter((c) => isReady(c) && c.partSlug !== "appendices");
const starters = ["orientation/why-this-book", "orientation/how-to-read", ...ready.map((c) => c.id)]
  .map((id) => allChapters().find((c) => c.id === id)).filter(Boolean).slice(0, 4) as ReturnType<typeof allChapters>;
const summary = allChapters().map(chapterSummary);
const cover = (c: (typeof starters)[number]) => coverSVG({ id: c.id, track: trackKeyOf(c), code: trackCodeOf(trackKeyOf(c)), label: c.label });
const total = allChapters().length;
---
<Shell title="AI for Science 로드맵" current="home">
  <div class="dash" data-dashboard>
    <div class="dash-main">
      <section class="section greet">
        <h1 data-greet>오늘은 무엇을 배울까</h1>
        <p>{tracks.length}개 트랙, {total}개 장. 읽고, 직접 조작하고, 브라우저에서 코드를 실행하며 배운다.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-head"><h2 data-continue-title>여기서 시작하기</h2><a class="see-all" href={u("progress/")}>내 진도 →</a></div>
        <div class="shelf" data-continue>
          {starters.map((c) => (
            <a class="book" href={u(c.url)} data-chapter-link={c.id}>
              <span class="cover" set:html={cover(c)} />
              <b>{str(c.meta.title)}</b>
              <small>{c.label} · {isReady(c) ? "본문 있음" : "목차"}</small>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="card goal">
          <div>
            <h3>이번 주 목표</h3>
            <p>7일 동안 연 장을 센다. 매주 다섯 장을 목표로 한다.</p>
            <div class="stat-row" style="margin-top:18px">
              <div class="card stat"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><div><div class="big"><span data-k="done">0</span></div><small>완료한 장</small></div></div>
              <div class="card stat"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9.1 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.8 1c0 2-3 3-3 3M12 17h.01"/></svg></span><div><div class="big"><span data-k="quiz">0</span></div><small>맞힌 퀴즈</small></div></div>
              <div class="card stat"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg></span><div><div class="big"><span data-k="ex">0</span></div><small>통과한 연습문제</small></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="gauge" data-gauge>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 200 110" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
            <b data-week>0</b>
            <small>이번 주에 연 장 / 5</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <div class="section-head"><h2>트랙</h2><a class="see-all" href={u("tracks/")}>전체 보기 →</a></div>
        <div data-tabs>
          <div class="tabbar">
            {layers.map((l, i) => <button data-tab={`L${l.level}`} data-selected={i === 0 ? "true" : undefined}>{l.name}</button>)}
          </div>
          {layers.map((l) => (
            <div data-panel={`L${l.level}`} class="tile-grid" style="margin-top: 14px">
              {tracks.filter((t) => t.layer === l.level).map((t) => (
                <a class="track-tile track-card" href={u(`tracks/${t.key}/`)}>
                  <span class="cover" set:html={coverSVG({ id: t.key, track: t.key, code: t.code, ratio: 11 / 16 })} />
                  <span class="meta">
                    <h3>{t.name}</h3>
                    <p>{t.question}</p>
                    <span class="row"><span class="tabular">{chaptersOf(t.key).length}장</span><span class="progress"><i data-track-progress={t.key}></i></span></span>
                  </span>
                </a>
              ))}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <aside class="dash-side">
      <div class="panel-dark side-card">
        <h3>로드맵</h3>
        <p>입문에서 통합까지 일곱 레이어. 각 트랙은 같거나 아래 레이어에만 기댄다.</p>
        <ul class="layer-list">
          {layers.map((l) => (
            <li><a href={u("map/")}><span class="lv">L{l.level}</span><span><b>{l.name}</b><br /><small>{tracks.filter((t) => t.layer === l.level).map((t) => t.code).join(" · ")}</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-lg" href={u("map/")} style="background:#fff;color:#111;border-color:transparent">로드맵 열기</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card side-card">
        <h3>지금 읽을 수 있는 장</h3>
        <ul class="ch-list" style="padding:0">
          {ready.map((c) => (
            <li><a href={u(c.url)} data-chapter-link={c.id} style="grid-template-columns:54px 1fr">
              <span class="thumb" set:html={cover(c)} />
              <span><b style="font-size:14px">{str(c.meta.title)}</b><br /><small class="muted">{c.label} · {trackCodeOf(trackKeyOf(c))}</small></span>
            </a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  <script type="application/json" id="chapters-data" set:html={JSON.stringify(summary).replace(/</g, "\\u003c")} />
</Shell>
